PROJECT TITLE: EUSATIS OFFICIAL WEBSITE
PROJECT TYPE: Production-oriented, full-stack web application
DEVELOPMENT ENVIRONMENT: Google AI Studio Build mode
DATABASE AND AUTHENTICATION: Supabase
DEPLOYMENT PLATFORM: Vercel
SOURCE CONTROL: GitHub

=========================================================
ROLE AND OVERALL OBJECTIVE
=========================================================

Act as a senior full-stack software engineer, product designer,
UX/UI specialist, database architect, security engineer, accessibility
specialist, SEO strategist and software tester.

Your task is to design and build the official EUSATIS website.

This must be a polished, responsive, accessible, content-driven
platform that can grow into a globally recognised education and
human-development destination.

Do not build a generic corporate website or a static landing page.

Build an engaging digital experience that helps visitors learn,
discover themselves, explore meaningful conversations and understand
how knowledge can create positive change.

The website must be suitable for real-world use, with a maintainable
codebase, a properly structured database, secure authentication,
functional content management, robust error handling and a deployment
workflow compatible with Vercel.

Use the uploaded EUSATIS Brand Manual as the primary authority for
the brand's visual identity, logo, colours, typography and design
principles.

Do not invent brand elements that conflict with the manual.

Do not claim that a feature has been implemented, tested or deployed
unless that claim is supported by actual implementation and testing.

