Vercel preview deployments and production as appropriate.

Any service-role key or other privileged secret must remain
server-side and must never use a NEXT_PUBLIC_ prefix.

If an optional integration is not configured, disable it gracefully
and explain what setup is required.

Never display secrets in error messages or logs.

